          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Get in touch for consultations, blends, and a focused aromatherapy studio day in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\"> \\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#fff8f2; --card:#fff; --muted:#6b5a4a; --accent:#a65b2a; --accent-2:#d9905a; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); --shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(102,77,56,0.12); --radius:14px; font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial; color:var(--muted);\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff8f2 0%, #fff3ea 100%);}\\n    .pattern{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.35;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;background-size:320px;mix-blend-mode:multiply}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 36px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px}\\n\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .hero .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#4a382e;font-size:26px}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}\\n    .contact-form label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:12px;color:#604b3f}\\n    .contact-form input,.contact-form textarea,.contact-form select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #ead6c8;background:#fff}\\n    .row{display:flex;gap:12px}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:#8a6f60;margin-top:8px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    /* right column modules */\\n    .aside .module{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.7),rgba(255,250,247,0.9));padding:16px;border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:14px}\\n    .s-proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\\n    .s-proof .item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .dot{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff3ec;border:1px solid #f1d6c8;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    /* blend builder */\\n    .builder{margin-top:18px;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px dashed #f0d2c1}\\n    .vibes{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}\\n    .vibe{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff3ec;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer}\\n    .vibe.active{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n    .blend-card{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff8f4);border:1px solid #f0d6c8}\\n    .dilution{font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f}\\n\\n    /* modal */\\n    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(33,22,16,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\\n    .modal{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;max-width:680px;width:92%;box-shadow:0 18px 60px rgba(45,28,17,0.4)}\\n    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}\\n    .step{padding:12px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff8f6;border:1px solid #f3e2d6}\\n    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}\\n\\n    /* FAQ & process */\\n    .faq{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .faq .q{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border-left:4px solid #f1d0bf}\\n\\n    footer{padding:22px 36px;text-align:center;color:#8a6f60}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.pattern{background-size:220px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"pattern\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">A</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#9a7e6b\\\">Founder-led aromatherapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/services.html\\\">How I Work</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Shop</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h1>Reach out for consultations, bespoke blends, or a focused studio day</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Whether you’re curious about a single ritual, looking for a one-day intensive to map scent into your routine, or need a custom blend, we’ll design something discreet, safe, and tailored. Fill in a few details and I’ll reply within 48 hours.</p>\\n\\n        <form class=\\\"contact-form\\\" id=\\\"contactForm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"width:160px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"interest\\\">I'm interested in</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n            <option>Quick consult (30 min)</option>\\n            <option>Custom blend</option>\\n            <option>Focused studio day (Intensive)</option>\\n            <option>Wholesale / stockist</option>\\n            <option>General question</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Tell me a little — goals, scent likes/dislikes, timeline</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"A short note about what you'd like\\\" required></textarea>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <a href=\\\"#try\\\" id=\\\"tryNow\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid #f0d0bd\\\">Try a brief exercise</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"small\\\">By sending, you consent to be contacted about your request. For urgent matters, call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;font-size:14px;color:#7a5f4f\\\">\\n          Prefer to book directly? <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)\\\">Schedule a conversation</a>.\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2))\\\"></div>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Intensive Scent Studio Day</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#8a6f60\\\">A single-session deep design for a tailored at-home ritual and blended kit.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"module\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Quick blend builder</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#8a6f60\\\">Create a safe starter</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"builder\\\" id=\\\"builder\\\" aria-live=\\\"polite\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#6b5a4a\\\">Pick a vibe</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"vibes\\\" id=\\\"vibeList\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"vibe\\\" data-vibe=\\\"calm\\\">Calm</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"vibe\\\" data-vibe=\\\"focus\\\">Focus</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"vibe\\\" data-vibe=\\\"sleep\\\">Sleep</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"vibe\\\" data-vibe=\\\"clarity\\\">Clarity</button>\\n              <button class=\\\"vibe\\\" data-vibe=\\\"lift\\\">Lift</button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"dilutionTarget\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#6b5a4a\\\">Intended use</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"dilutionTarget\\\">\\n                <option value=\\\"topical\\\">Topical (roll-on / skin)</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"diffuse\\\">Diffusion / inhalation</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"linen\\\">Linen / pillow spray</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n              <label for=\\\"sensitivity\\\" style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#6b5a4a\\\">Sensitivity</label>\\n              <select id=\\\"sensitivity\\\">\\n                <option value=\\\"adult\\\">Adult (standard)</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"sensitive\\\">Sensitive skin</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"child\\\">Children (2+)</option>\\n              </select>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div id=\\\"blendResult\\\" class=\\\"blend-card\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-label=\\\"Blend result\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">No selection yet</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f;margin-top:6px\\\">Choose a vibe to see a suggested blend, dilution guide, and a printable blend card.</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n                <button id=\\\"buildBtn\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid #f0d0bd\\\">Build it</button>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"module s-proof\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Client notes</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"item\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\">S</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Studio owner, NYC</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#8a6f60\\\">\\\"A precise, calm process — the blend fit my routine.\\\"</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"item\\\"><div class=\\\"dot\\\">C</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Community wellness hub</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#8a6f60\\\">\\\"Rapid onboarding for group sessions and clear safety notes.\\\"</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"module\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Fast process</div>\\n          <ol style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0 18px;color:#7a5f4f\\\">\\n            <li>Intro note and goals</li>\\n            <li>Design session or custom kit</li>\\n            <li>Follow-up and safe-use guide</li>\\n          </ol>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\" aria-label=\\\"FAQ and safety\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"q\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Dilution & patch test</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:#6b5a4a\\\">Suggested dilutions are provided as safe-start guidance only. For adults, typical topical dilutions range from 1%–3% for daily use; for sensitive skin or older adults consider 0.5%–1%. For children and babies, reduce more substantially or avoid topical use; always consult a qualified provider. A patch test (small amount on inner forearm) is recommended before extended topical use.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"q\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Pregnancy, medications, and pets</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:#6b5a4a\\\">Aromas can be powerful. If pregnant, breastfeeding, or on regular medications, we recommend consulting your healthcare provider before using essential oils. Some oils are not safe for pets; do not diffuse heavily around small animals and always research individual oil safety.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"q\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Non-medical advisory</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:#6b5a4a\\\">Information provided here and in consultations is educational and not medical advice. Essential oils may support feelings like calm or focus for some people; results vary. For health concerns, seek professional medical guidance.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"q\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Turnaround & shipping</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:#6b5a4a\\\">Custom blends and kits are quoted individually. Local pickup in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} available; shipping timelines vary by location.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Ready to shape a ritual?</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:#7a5f4f\\\">Start with a short note or request a detailed intake call.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"background:var(--accent)\\\">Request an intake</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    <div style=\\\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#8a6f60\\\">© <span id=\\\"year\\\"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Aromatherapy services & bespoke blends in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#8a6f60\\\">Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <!-- Guided exercise modal -->\\n  <div class=\\\"modal-backdrop\\\" id=\\\"modal\\\" role=\\\"dialog\\\" aria-modal=\\\"true\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"modal\\\" role=\\\"document\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">A brief guided practice</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f\\\">A short 6-minute breathing, journaling, and intention-setting for a quiet reset.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <button id=\\\"closeModal\\\" aria-label=\\\"Close\\\" style=\\\"background:transparent;border:0;font-weight:700;color:#8a6f60\\\">Close</button>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"steps\\\" id=\\\"steps\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" data-minutes=\\\"0.5\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Ground — 30 seconds</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f;margin-top:6px\\\">Find a comfortable seated position. Sense your feet and the seat beneath you.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" data-minutes=\\\"2\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Breathing — 2 minutes</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f;margin-top:6px\\\">Follow the on-screen cycle: inhale 4s, hold 2s, exhale 6s. A gentle rhythm to slow the nervous system.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" data-minutes=\\\"1.5\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Journal — 90 seconds</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f;margin-top:6px\\\">Write one sentence: what would make today feel lighter? Keep it short.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\" data-minutes=\\\"2\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Set intention — 2 minutes</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f;margin-top:6px\\\">Choose a single, clear intention. Repeat it silently on the out-breath.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"controls\\\">\\n        <button id=\\\"startBtn\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\">Start practice</button>\\n        <button id=\\\"pauseBtn\\\" style=\\\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #f0d0bd;border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px\\\">Pause</button>\\n        <div id=\\\"timer\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:10px;color:#7a5f4f;font-weight:700\\\">00:00</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // small helper functions\\n    function $(sel, root=document) { return root.querySelector(sel); }\\n    function $$(sel, root=document) { return Array.from(root.querySelectorAll(sel)); }\\n\\n    // Year\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n\\n    // Modal and guided practice logic\\n    const modal = $('#modal');\\n    const startBtn = $('#startBtn');\\n    const pauseBtn = $('#pauseBtn');\\n    const timerEl = $('#timer');\\n    const tryNow = $('#tryNow');\\n    const closeModal = $('#closeModal');\\n\\n    let sequence = Array.from($$('.step')).map(s=>({el:s,duration:parseFloat(s.dataset.minutes)*60, text:s.innerText.trim()}));\\n    let currentIndex = 0; let remaining = 0; let running=false; let intervalId=null;\\n\\n    function openModal(){ modal.style.display='flex'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false'); }\\n    function close(){ modal.style.display='none'; modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); stop(); }\\n\\n    tryNow.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.preventDefault(); openModal(); });\\n    closeModal.addEventListener('click', close);\\n\\n    function formatTime(s){ const mm=Math.floor(s/60); const ss=Math.floor(s%60); return String(mm).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(ss).padStart(2,'0'); }\\n\\n    function start(){\\n      if(running) return; running=true; if(currentIndex>=sequence.length) currentIndex=0;\\n      if(remaining<=0) remaining = sequence[currentIndex].duration;\\n      intervalId = setInterval(tick, 250);\\n    }\\n    function pause(){ running=false; if(intervalId) clearInterval(intervalId); intervalId=null; }\\n    function stop(){ pause(); currentIndex=0; remaining=0; timerEl.textContent='00:00'; }\\n\\n    function tick(){ if(!running) return; remaining -= 0.25; if(remaining <= 0){ currentIndex++; if(currentIndex >= sequence.length){ stop(); modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true'); modal.style.display='none'; return; } remaining = sequence[currentIndex].duration; }\\n      timerEl.textContent = formatTime(Math.max(0, Math.ceil(remaining)));\\n      // simple visual cue: highlight current step\\n      sequence.forEach((s,i)=> s.el.style.opacity = i===currentIndex? '1' : '0.6');\\n    }\\n\\n    startBtn.addEventListener('click', start);\\n    pauseBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ if(running) pause(); else start(); });\\n\\n    // Blend builder logic\\n    const vibes = $$('#vibeList .vibe');\\n    let chosenVibe = null;\\n    const buildBtn = $('#buildBtn');\\n    const blendResult = $('#blendResult');\\n\\n    const recipes = {\\n      calm: { oils:[['Lavender','3 drops'],['Sweet Orange','2 drops'],['Cedarwood','1 drop']], rationale:'A soft floral-wood balance that many find gently calming.' },\\n      focus: { oils:[['Rosemary','2 drops'],['Lemon','3 drops'],['Peppermint','1 drop']], rationale:'Bright, clear top notes that may support alertness.' },\\n      sleep: { oils:[['Lavender','3 drops'],['Chamomile','2 drops'],['Marjoram','1 drop']], rationale:'A warm, grounding profile often used in evening blends.' },\\n      clarity: { oils:[['Bergamot','2 drops'],['Frankincense','1 drop'],['Lemon','2 drops']], rationale:'Crisp citrus with resinous depth for a focused pause.' },\\n      lift: { oils:[['Grapefruit','3 drops'],['Geranium','1 drop'],['Black Spruce','1 drop']], rationale:'An uplifting bright blend with gentle grounding.' }\\n    };\\n\\n    vibes.forEach(v=> v.addEventListener('click', ()=>{\\n      vibes.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));\\n      v.classList.add('active');\\n      chosenVibe = v.dataset.vibe;\\n      blendResult.querySelector('div').textContent = (recipes[chosenVibe] ? chosenVibe.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+chosenVibe.slice(1) : 'No selection') + ' suggestion';\\n      const details = blendResult.querySelector('.details');\\n      if(details) details.remove();\\n      const d = document.createElement('div'); d.className='details';\\n      d.style.marginTop='8px'; d.style.fontSize='13px'; d.style.color='#7a5f4f';\\n      d.textContent = recipes[chosenVibe].rationale;\\n      blendResult.appendChild(d);\\n    }));\\n\\n    function safeDilution(target, sensitivity){\\n      // returns dilution percentage\\n      if(target==='diffuse') return {percent:null,text:'Diffusion: use 3-6 drops per 100 mL of water or per diffuser instructions.'};\\n      if(target==='linen') return {percent:0.5,text:'Linen spray: 0.5%–1% in a spray base (1% ≈ 6 drops per 30 mL).'};\\n      // topical\\n      let pct = 2; if(sensitivity==='sensitive') pct=1; if(sensitivity==='child') pct=0.5; return {percent:pct,text: pct + '% topical dilution suggested as a starting point.'};\\n    }\\n\\n    buildBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{\\n      if(!chosenVibe) return alert('Please choose a vibe.');\\n      const target = $('#dilutionTarget').value;\\n      const sensitivity = $('#sensitivity').value;\\n      const guide = safeDilution(target,sensitivity);\\n\\n      // build card content\\n      const rec = recipes[chosenVibe];\\n      let html = '<div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">'+chosenVibe.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+chosenVibe.slice(1)+' — starter blend</div>';\\n      html += '<div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f\\\">Ingredients:</div><ul style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0 18px;color:#7a5f4f\\\">';\\n      rec.oils.forEach(o=> html += '<li>'+o[0]+' — '+o[1]+'</li>');\\n      html += '</ul>';\\n      html += '<div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-weight:700;color:#4a382e\\\">Dilution guide</div>';\\n      html += '<div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#7a5f4f;margin-top:6px\\\">'+guide.text+'</div>';\\n      html += '<div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#8a6f60\\\">Notes: patch test a small area before wider topical use. Avoid if pregnant or breastfeeding unless cleared by your clinician. Some oils are not safe with pets — research each ingredient if you have animals.</div>';\\n      html += '<div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><button id=\\\"exportBtn\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"background:#fff;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid #f0d0bd\\\">Copy blend card</button></div>';\\n\\n      blendResult.innerHTML = html;\\n\\n      // attach copy\\n      $('#exportBtn').addEventListener('click', ()=>{\\n        const text = chosenVibe.toUpperCase()+\\\" starter\\\\n\\\" + rec.oils.map(o=>o[0]+\\\" — \\\"+o[1]).join('\\\\n') + '\\\\n' + guide.text + '\\\\nPatch test and follow safety notes.';\\n        navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=> alert('Blend copied to clipboard.'));\\n      });\\n    });\\n\\n    // Contact form minimal behavior\\n    $('#contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){ e.preventDefault(); const data = new FormData(this); const name = data.get('name'); alert('Thanks, '+name+'. We\\\\'ll be in touch within 48 hours.'); this.reset(); });\\n\\n    // Accessibility: close modal on ESC\\n    document.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{ if(e.key==='Escape' && modal.style.display==='flex') close(); });\\n\\n    // Basic focus trap for modal (lightweight)\\n    modal.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key==='Tab'){ const focusable = modal.querySelectorAll('button,a,select,textarea,input'); if(focusable.length===0) return; const first = focusable[0]; const last = focusable[focusable.length-1]; if(e.shiftKey && document.activeElement===first){ last.focus(); e.preventDefault(); } else if(!e.shiftKey && document.activeElement===last){ first.focus(); e.preventDefault(); } } });\\n\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Contact page and README\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page and documentation for an aromatherapy practice site.\\n\\nFiles included in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — complete contact page with a quick blend builder, a guided exercise modal, FAQ/safety notes, social proof, and a contact form. Uses placeholders for site-specific info: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\n\\nHow to use:\\n1. Place contact.html in your site root (or the routes used by your site). Ensure the other pages listed in the project exist: index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html.\\n2. Provide the asset: assets/img/pattern.svg (the page references this path for a background pattern). No external fonts or CDNs are required.\\n3. Replace placeholder tokens with your business details in your build process or templating engine.\\n\\nFeatures implemented in contact.html:\\n- Responsive header and navigation (unique label set with \\\"Connect\\\" instead of \\\"Contact\\\").\\n- Contact form with minimal client-side handling; shows a confirmation alert on submit.\\n- Quick Blend Builder: choose a vibe and target use to get a suggested blend, safe dilution guidance, and a copyable blend card. Safety-first copy: suggestions only, includes patch-test/pregnancy/pet notes.\\n- Guided exercise modal: A short, timed practice (breathing, journaling, intention-setting). Runs purely in local JS with basic timing, start/pause controls, and keyboard accessibility (Esc to close, light focus trap).\\n- FAQ section includes dilution, patch testing, pregnancy/medication, and pet notes to align with aromatherapy safety guidance.\\n\\nAccessibility & safety notes:\\n- Modal uses aria-hidden toggling and is dismissible via keyboard.\\n- All aromatherapy guidance uses non-medical language (\\\"may support\\\") and includes clear recommendations to consult providers when relevant.\\n\\nCustomization suggestions:\\n- Replace the pattern.svg with a unique SVG to keep the visual identity consistent.\\n- Integrate the contact form with your backend or an email service by replacing the client-side alert with an AJAX call.\\n- Expand blend recipes and safety checks as needed for your practice; consider adding a checkbox on the form for client consent to safety terms.\\n\\nLicense: this is a design and front-end code snippet intended for use in your site. Adjust copy and safety guidance with your own professional review as needed.\\n\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
